 continuar tu colecci\u00f3n o jugar de nuevo desde el principio. Abandonar un video antes de terminar no entrega su estampa.\n\nNarraci\u00f3n e interfaz en espa\u00f1ol. Para un jugador, sentado o de pie, sin locomoci\u00f3n artificial ni seguimiento de manos. Los videos est\u00e1n incluidos en la aplicaci\u00f3n y no requieren un servicio de streaming.", "short_description": "Descubre monta\u00f1as, valles, llanuras y costas en una gran pantalla virtual. Completa cuatro actividades, re\u00fane estampas \u00fanicas y desbloquea el final del \u00c1lbum del Explorador. Una experiencia educativa para un jugador, con narraci\u00f3n e interfaz en espa\u00f1ol, controles Quest y videos incluidos en el dispositivo."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.academusdigital.com/politica-de-privacidad-apps/", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "AcademusDigital", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://www.academusdigital.com/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "362692211442873", "context_category": "APPS"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "1043107547362485"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["es_MX"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["SITTING", "STANDING"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "1278708758669303"}, "review_messages": []}]}, "cover_square_image": {"uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/816087235_947698944724491_849710432084217401_n.png?stp=dst-png_s360x360&_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=F19cjqWofdwQ7kNvwFX7Z5S&_nc_oc=Ado2Ho_z7pA89NCuKKL1igw3uM8QJVp6EK5IV40UBElecHqhOS82ijwsX8